requirement "A stored price is the item's price"
    given prices is empty
    when Prices receives PUT /prices/bolt-m6 with "250"
    then Prices replies OK with "250"
    when Prices receives GET /prices/bolt-m6
    then Prices replies OK with "250"

requirement "A price of nothing is refused"
    given prices is empty
    when Prices receives PUT /prices/bolt-m6 with "0"
    then Prices replies BadRequest
    and prices is empty
